#: manual/package_reference.md:3
msgid "This page is the maintainer-oriented map of the `0.3.0` public surface. Exact generic signatures live in each `src/<package>/pkg.generated.mbti`; this page explains which boundary owns a decision, what is measured, and what must stay out of a timed region."
